    "background_story": "Penelope's life was forever changed when she witnessed a devastating car accident at the age of 16. The traumatic event left her with physical scars and emotional wounds that took years to heal. As she struggled to cope with the aftermath, Penelope found solace in art, using her paintings as a way to express the emotions she couldn't verbalize. Her experiences inspired a series of hauntingly beautiful pieces that caught the attention of art critics and therapists alike. Soon, Penelope's work was being used as a tool for trauma therapy, helping others process their own painful memories. Through her art, Penelope transformed her trauma into a source of strength, using her story to help others heal and find hope in the darkest of times.",
